Start admin website

    cd ~/DETECT-CO/admin_web
    npm run dev

Start laptop-hosted ML API and temporary HTTPS tunnel

    cd ~/DETECT-CO-ML
    bash ./start-tunnel.sh

Keep the tunnel terminal open. Copy the trycloudflare.com URL it prints, then
run Flutter with that URL (temporary URLs change when the tunnel restarts):

    cd ~/DETECT-CO
    flutter run --dart-define=ML_API_URL=https://replace-me.trycloudflare.com/predict

Stop the API and tunnel with Ctrl-C in the tunnel terminal, or from another
terminal run:

    cd ~/DETECT-CO-ML
    bash ./stop-tunnel.sh

Start notification listener

    cd ~/DETECT-CO
    node functions/announcement-listener.js
